call SaveGroupHandle(h,id,12,CreateGroup())
call UnitAddAbility(u,'A133')
if GetUnitTypeId(u)=='H05A' then
set soundplay=CreateSound("Sound\\Music\\mp3Music\\ShiroBow.mp3",false,false,true,12700,12700,"")
call StartSound(soundplay)
call KillSoundWhenDone(soundplay)
else
set soundplay=CreateSound("Sound\\Music\\mp3Music\\Caladbolg.mp3",false,false,true,12700,12700,"")
call StartSound(soundplay)
call SetSoundVolumeBJ(soundplay,100)
call KillSoundWhenDone(soundplay)
endif
call TimerStart(t,0.1,true,function ArchersBowCast2)
set u=null
set p=null
set t=null
endfunction
function MissleMoveKatsuya2 takes nothing returns nothing
local timer t=GetExpiredTimer()
local integer id=GetHandleId(t)
local unit l__d=LoadUnitHandle(h,id,0)
local unit c=LoadUnitHandle(h,id,4)
local real speed=LoadReal(h,id,1)
local real angle=LoadReal(h,id,2)
local real x=GetUnitX(l__d)
local real y=GetUnitY(l__d)
local real x1=GetUnitX(c)
local real y1=GetUnitY(c)
local integer ip=GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(l__d))
local real a=Atan2(y1-y,x1-x)+angle
local group g=LoadGroupHandle(h,GetHandleId(Hero[ip]),StringHash("kuchiyose"))
if SR(x,y,x1,y1)>30 then
call SetUnitXY_1(l__d,x+speed*Cos(a),y+speed*Sin(a), false)
call SetUnitFacing(l__d,a*bj_RADTODEG)
else
call UnitAddAbility(c,'A149')
call UnitMakeAbilityPermanent(c,true,'A149')
call GroupAddUnit(g,c)
call RemoveUnit(l__d)
call PauseTimer(t)
call DestroyTimer(t)
call FlushChildHashtable(h,id)
endif
set g=null
set c=null
set l__d=null
set t=null
endfunction
function MissleMoveKatsuya takes unit l__d,real speed,real angle,unit target,string l__s,real dmg,unit damager returns nothing
